WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:02.850
His goal is to make the Seven Pillars bloom.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.860
The problem is that he used to act alone,

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:09.610
but now he's teamed up with a troublesome bunch.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.490
A dragon killer.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:12.900
A vampire hunter.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.860
An exorcist.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.410
And... a necromancer.

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:21.000
Where did all that strength come from?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.540
I'll be taking her back.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:27.290
She's my toy!

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.710
How could someone undead move without a talisman?

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:34.210
Regardless of how, the fact is that she did.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.550
I'll have to look into this.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.800
This confirms it.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.550
They're making their move.

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.770
There goes your peaceful lives.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:49.560
It's just the matter of time until someone gets kidnapped.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:54.150
How are you guys still stuffing yourselves with such gusto?!

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:55.800
It's really good, though.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:56.610
They're right.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.740
Why are you eating too?

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.820
Oh, quit being so uptight.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.990
You can't fight on an empty stomach.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:08.830
That ramen is Rin's new recipe.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.460
Give it a try.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.850
Geez.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:16.750
I'm stuffed! It was great!

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.760
I feel stronger than I was yesterday.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.840
I'll be fine.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:24.720
Master,

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:30.690
be sure to tell Rin that her new recipe's pretty good.

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:34.690
Yeah, it's fantastic!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:35.980
Crazy good!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:36.190
Houhouran
Crazy good!

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.230
Houhouran
Sure thing!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.360
Now then, patrol time!

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.740
Hey, guys!

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:44.410
Start from the first block!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.870
I'll check the papers at the office.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.120
Then I'll do my best at slack—

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.460
How about you do some work, Kotoha-chan?

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.880
Oh, come on!

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.000
Man, that was ice cold.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.920
They all left already?

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.220
You know, District Mayor...

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:15.770
If that necromancer happens to be Rin's old acquaintance,

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:27.030
I'd sure love to discuss some things with her.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:32.000
Would you be so kind as to bring her here?

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:39.050
Rin's so damn lucky.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:44.090
Both humans and youkai are rushing to her aid.

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.310
Most aren't as fortunate.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:53.480
Unlike Yae, I won't help you.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.390
We're leaving.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:58.310
Just a moment.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:04:59.940
What is it?

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.980
I'm not the kind of god who fulfills wishes.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.320
That's not it.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:07.620
Ramen for seven—that'll be 4,900 yen.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:10.790
Those little...

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:05.380
Don't be afraid.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:12.760
Come.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.900
Zakuro-chan...

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.160
You're just a toy.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.660
How long are you gonna keep sleeping?

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:41.670
You shouldn't stray too far from your master, you bad girl.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:48.220
I told you I'd protect you.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.610
I see you've got what you wanted.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:14.950
Quit stalking me. It's creepy.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:19.960
That's rich, coming from someone who has a corpse for a friend.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.790
You don't have to breathe down my neck.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.630
I'm not paying you for nothing, you know.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:28.210
I'll hold up my end of the contract.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:31.380
Should I hold onto this until then?

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:43.060
You don't have to worry. I'll do my job.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.070
Let me be, all right?

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:48.070
Just sit back and watch.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.080
All quiet in the third block too.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.580
Wait, what's that?

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.090
Just one...

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.420
Hey! Hime!

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.420
Rinnoji's been kidnapped!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.630
Juri-san was caught off-guard.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:51.920
They're right there.

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:59.430
I don't have time to waste on you two.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:03.730
Hime!

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.350
I'll give this back later!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.310
I'll go call Kyousuke!

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:09.940
Don't lose track of them!

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:27.580
Fine.

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:33.710
Guess I can play with you a little.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.980
What's your name?

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:52.360
I'm the mayor of Sakura Newtown, Yarizakura Hime.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:56.240
My name is Zakuro. Kurumaki Zakuro.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:04.790
I'll admit, you're quite strong.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.880
But you're boring.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.380
There's nothing special about a strong youkai.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:19.090
Isn't there anyone more interesting in this town?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:20.300
Hime!

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.390
Milady!

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:26.230
Are you all right?

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:29.900
I told you to call me "mayor" while on duty!

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.820
Cloudsplitter!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.200
Wavestrike!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.710
Raging Waves!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:01.430
Oh, you beat her already?

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.010
Milady!

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:08.560
Something's not right. She hardly put up a fight.

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.020
Aren't Youkai Hunters supposed to be strong?

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.070
Come on, weren't you listening?

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:20.700
It's not pure strength that makes us powerful.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:24.160
That's how Youkai Hunters roll.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:29.460
In my case, <i>I'm</i> not the one that needs to be strong.

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:31.330
Do you get it?

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:34.840
Necromancy.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.130
Bingo!

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:39.840
My power is in controlling my toys.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.220
That hurt.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.510
Snap out of it, Rin!

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.640
Kyousuke!

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.020
Kyousuke...

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.790
I'll protect you.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.800
Don't you call our precious citizen a toy!

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:09.050
Nice one, Akina.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.810
Prepare yourself!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:16.270
So naïve! You're just so naïve!

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:21.280
If I don't have a corpse to control, I can just make one!

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:24.820
I can accelerate life and hasten death.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:30.830
Necromancers control corpses and the time of death.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:36.830
That's what makes me powerful!

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:39.840
See?

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:43.090
Good luck, Hime!

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.090
Gonna need it!

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:51.850
What's this?

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:56.190
Damn it!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:13:59.940
Then...

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.150
I'll hit her directly!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.030
Milady!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.210
How boring.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:19.540
You won't be able to beat me with brute force.

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:27.590
Wall!

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.310
Now that's what I'm talking about!

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.560
You seem like you're more entertaining!

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:41.020
A half-youkai...

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:45.030
Someone who became a half-human,
half-youkai hybrid after being struck...

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:48.070
A monster, just like me!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:52.490
Don't group me together with you!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:56.080
I'm different from you bunch who've forgotten who you really are and only destroy things.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:59.580
You know, you stink.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:04.090
Far more than anyone else here.

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.300
You really do.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.680
Come on! Come get me!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:18.770
Kill me and you'll realize what I mean, whether you want to or not.

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:23.610
You'll realize that you <i>are</i> a monster.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.940
Of course, that's assuming you actually have what it takes.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:28.780
Kotoha.

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.280
Give me something long.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.990
Shortcut: Corsesca.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.500
Ow!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.420
What the heck was that for?!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:46.380
Not this.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.340
I don't need something so dangerous.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.130
Huh?

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.930
Death puts an end to everything.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.890
You've seen this scenario before.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:57.850
Settle things, not end them.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:01.390
You're here with us today
because we believe in that.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.520
Fine, I get it.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.520
Then let's punish her,

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.820
lecture her,

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:13.320
and wrap things up by making her apologize.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.700
Sound good?

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.080
Whoa, Juri-chan!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.660
Shouldn't you slow down a bit?

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.420
It's this way, right, Ao?

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.210
Yes! They're at the riverbank!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.050
Please, let's hurry!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:29.050
Roger that!

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.970
Say, what're we using...

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:34.300
these for?

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.480
They left me behind.

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:45.650
Well, you see—

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.570
You really <i>are</i> strong!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:04.080
I'm good when it comes to one-on-one fights,

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:07.500
but she's better at handling multiple opponents.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.380
For you to be this formidable...

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:18.600
It's hot...

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.010
It's burning hot!

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:23.890
I can feel my body burning up as the power courses through me!

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:33.900
Are we shooting a monster film or something?

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.780
Well, aren't you fast?

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.540
Shortcut!

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:49.590
Shortcut!

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.800
Shortcut:

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:54.130
Hammer!

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:04.770
Beams!

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:09.770
Shortcut: Gasoline!

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:19.570
Bam!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.530
Faster.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:27.660
Bam! Bam! Bam! Bam! Bam! Bam! Bam! Bam! Bam! Bam! Bam!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.170
And to finish this off...

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:49.650
<i>The mechanism behind the monster's movement is like that of any living being.</i>

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:57.900
<i>Signals are sent through the nervous system to control the limbs.</i>

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:07.200
Bioelectricity.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:10.170
That's what's making you move.

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:13.170
Juri-san, I leave it to you!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:16.670
You got me good at the clinic,

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.510
so let me return the favor!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.260
Shortcut:

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:29.520
Bunker Buster!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.870
<i>My name is Azuma Rin.</i>

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:46.910
<i>I'm good at cooking.</i>

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.410
<i>My favorite food is gyoza.</i>

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.580
<i>Oh, I like taking walks too.</i>

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.830
<i>Something I hate?</i>

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.420
<i>I hate...</i>

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.510
<i>skies dotted with stars.</i>

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.680
I'll protect you.

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.640
I'm alone too.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:16.360
So let's live together.

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:29.700
Yeah, that's it.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:33.830
You can loosen up a bit more.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:34.880
Okay!

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:44.720
This is your first time cooking, right?

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:45.390
Yes.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.390
Thanks for the food!

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.930
Wow, it's really good!

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.390
Goodness. You might even be better than me!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:59.940
In that case, would you let me cook for you again after I learn more recipes?

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:01.030
Of course!

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:02.900
Oh, great!

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:04.910
Huh?

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:08.280
You're scared of stars?

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:13.580
I've always been running alone.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:16.420
I'm undead, so I can't sleep when it's night time.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:25.090
When I'm under the starry sky, I...

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.430
It'll be fine.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:30.560
From today on, this is your home.

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:33.600
You have a roof over your head now!

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:35.560
Okay?

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:39.360
Yeah.

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:59.670
Say, Zakuro-chan.

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:00.460
Yes?

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:04.170
Why did you help me?

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:09.260
Because I was alone too, I guess.

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:10.550
Alone?

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:15.140
I was the one that said I'd protect you,

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:20.060
but I think the truth is, <i>I</i> wanted to be protected.

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:23.070
Zakuro-chan...

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:27.820
Anyway, if we're together, neither of us are alone anymore.

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:32.950
We'll always be together.

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:35.450
Yeah.

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:44.090
We'll always...

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:46.920
be together.

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:51.720
Zakuro-chan?

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:55.470
So why don't we go together?

00:22:55.470 --> 00:22:59.730
Go and slaughter everyone that hurt you, that is.

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:00.770
No...

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:04.230
It'll be fine.

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.490
I'll protect you.

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:19.250
You're not too shabby, necromancer.

00:23:21.630 --> 00:23:24.210
Even without anything to control, I'm enough for...

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:25.250
Stop!

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:27.380
Rin?!

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:29.760
Please, Zakuro-chan, just stop it!

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:31.760
Rin...

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:35.760
I just came here to take you back.

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:39.770
It's an owner's responsibility to take back a lost pet, after all.

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:41.600
That's a bad joke.

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:43.270
A pet? A toy?

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:45.940
I'm not letting you take Rin!

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:48.280
Leave this town this instant!

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:53.280
Even if I were to retreat this time,
I'd come back as many times as it takes.

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:58.290
And every time I come, I'll be sure to leave my mark on this town!

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.290
Marks that'll never disappear.

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.000
Rin, come over here.

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:07.550
Rin!

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:09.550
Hime-chan, I'm sorry.

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:14.970
You and the others, the owners of Houhouran,

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:17.560
and all the townspeople...

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:20.600
The past two years I've spent with you have been like a dream.

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:22.520
But you know...

00:24:23.140 --> 00:24:25.810
Zakuro-chan has always been alone.

00:24:26.560 --> 00:24:27.650
She...

00:24:29.070 --> 00:24:31.900
She was the first one to be kind to me,

00:24:31.900 --> 00:24:35.490
the first to praise my cooking,

00:24:36.740 --> 00:24:41.120
and the first one to welcome me into her bright home.

00:24:41.120 --> 00:24:43.040
That's Zakuro-chan.

00:24:46.500 --> 00:24:47.880
I...

00:24:47.880 --> 00:24:50.010
will leave with Zakuro-chan.

00:24:59.220 --> 00:25:02.890
Zakuro-chan, that's enough.

00:25:03.480 --> 00:25:05.310
Let's go home together.

00:25:06.690 --> 00:25:07.810
No way...

00:25:09.190 --> 00:25:12.190
Please. Let's live together.

00:25:46.060 --> 00:25:47.310
That power...

00:25:49.940 --> 00:25:50.860
Enjin.

00:26:04.450 --> 00:26:08.370
Say, how many people live in this town?

00:26:15.260 --> 00:26:18.380
It's 2,040, according to the latest info.

00:26:22.760 --> 00:26:27.060
How splendid! Magnificent!

00:26:27.060 --> 00:26:32.150
Then that means today, my collection...

00:26:32.900 --> 00:26:35.900
is getting 2,040 new pieces!

00:26:35.900 --> 00:26:38.240
Now isn't that amazing?!
